Z||000004||88 Fiero||10-14-1999||03:17 PM||||Hey Cliff...How does a Fiero V6 Speedo reads in ...is it Finland or Netherlands??? Does it read "KPH" or "MPH"???||||reg||1
Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||10-14-1999||06:03 PM||||Fiero56: I can turn the ignition on and take out the keys... All fieros do this (at least all my fieros did).<P>88 Fiero: We use the metric system in Holland (like in Canada), so the speedo reads in KPH. <P>Before anyone wonders: no, I wasn't driving the car when I took these pictures!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> The dash has a special testmode where it emulates values for the Speedo and the Tach.<BR>||||reg||1
